ents/kombu]], [[ingredients/nori]], [[ingredients/wakame]], [[ingredients/freshwater-fish]] (currently stub), [[ingredients/tilapia]], [[ingredients/freshwater-bass]], [[ingredients/tuna]], [[ingredients/swordfish]], [[ingredients/marlin]], [[ingredients/mackerel]], [[products/seaweed-snacks]], [[products/freshwater-fish]], [[products/canned-tuna]], [[mitigation/watershed-source-screening]]; these are downstream wiki work to be scoped separately. Synthesis backlog remaining: jarosite co-mitigation (1/4, awaiting 2 corroborating studies), dietary-supplement Pb (1/4, awaiting 2 corroborating A/B-tier studies), Egypt regulatory baseline (do-not-promote, methodology-note territory).

