+| Matrix | Product/formula scope | Lead | Arsenic | Mercury |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|
+| Body lotion | Formula 1 control plus formulas 2-3 with Arabica or civet coffee extract | Not detected | <0.16 mg/kg | <0.09 mg/kg |
